+
+/*
+ * THE HEADLINE NAMES THE THING AND WHERE TO LOOK (Batch LIVE, Section 2.1;
+ * it said "Worth a look · One thing in the sky now"). The most specific of
+ * what is worth a look leads: rays, then a halo, then iridescence, then
