+/*
+ * THE SKY PAGES (Batch LIVE, Section 2). The headline names the thing and
+ * where to look; the Now picture draws the decks with their gaps; rare
+ * light is rare: on 14 Nov the list had light rays at 3 PM nearly every day
+ * with the sun 18-19° up (measurements/2026-11-14-rare-light-before.md); the
